- [[ Kerasous ]]
- [[ Lampsacus ]]
- [[ Leros ]]
- [[ Limnae | limnae-bithynia ]]
- [[ Miletopolis ]]
- [[ Myrmekion ]] (?)
- [[ Nymphaion | nymphaion-crimea ]]
- [[ Odessos | varna-bulgaria ]]
- [[ Olbia | olbia-ukraine ]]
- [[ Paesus ]]
- [[ Panticapaeum ]]
- [[ Parium ]]
- [[ Patraeus | patraeus-city ]]
